                                "sense_id": "aaaf6925-8292-35c1-b711-b010127f68b4",
                                "text": "Poirot's lips moved. Inspector Colgate leaned forward. Poirot was murmuring, \"It's so difficult to know which pieces are part of the fur rug and which are the cat's tail.\""
